TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution at 100C, pe 4, initial pH 5
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH   5 charge
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn   1
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 10.0 0.001
        -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -pH true
END
